-- **A plain import beside a narrowed `public import` of the same module** —
-- his case of 2026-11-10, a file that wants all of `Twins` for itself and
-- passes on only part of it. The two lines are independent facts: this file
-- writes `Tri`, and `GetsOnlyWhatTravelled.thena` cannot.
module test.modules.BothLines where

import test.modules.Twins
public import test.modules.Twins ( Bit )

mine : Tri.Tri
mine = Tri.lo
